#. Context: Help › FAQ question
#: uvalu/pages_/help.py:71
msgid "How is the composite fair value calculated?"
msgstr ""

#. Context: Help › FAQ answer
#: uvalu/pages_/help.py:72
msgid "Each holding is valued by all six models. Outliers are trimmed and the remainder averaged into a single composite fair value. Margin of safety is the discount of the current price to that figure."
msgstr ""

#. Context: Help › FAQ question
#: uvalu/pages_/help.py:75
msgid "What does the conviction score mean?"
msgstr ""

#. Context: Help › FAQ answer
#: uvalu/pages_/help.py:76
msgid "A 0–100 weighted mean of the signal scores across your scored holdings, weighted by position size. Vetoed names are excluded from the average."
